Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.50,1:34:00.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《驯龙高手3：隐秘的世界》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是恶魔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.49,0:01:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是 我不是恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm not a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？就是个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Just a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来这里解救这些龙的人 所以我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a guy here to rescue these dragons, so, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:01:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是你从火中走了出来！- 龙鳞而已！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you walked through fire! - Dragon scales!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙经常蜕皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons shed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 恶魔我可认得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know a demon when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的腿哪有这么细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No human legs are that skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这出场方式不错吧？隆重登场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that's a good entrance? Get a load of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道！不止一个恶魔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it! More demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's really just a nitwit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了给屁股防火的傻瓜而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who forgot to fireproof his butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,烫 烫 太烫了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 先别出手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, no, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看呀 你最恐怖的噩梦来临了 - 看呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Behold, your worst nightmare. - Behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这位非要跟来的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with his sister, who insisted on coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这样介绍我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my intro?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 太快了 你们总是来的太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, too soon. You always come in too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.73,0:02:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我还不太会控制我的翅膀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, still getting the hang of my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼脚司 你又带宝宝来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishlegs, again with the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可是突袭 - 我找不到保姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a raid. - I couldn't find a sitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是恶魔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚丝翠 我都把他安排好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astrid. I had him right where I wanted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在我已经把他安排好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's right where I wanted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始干活吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们搞砸了开场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we screwed that up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是起码没有别人知道我们在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least nobody else knows we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 姑娘 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, girl. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来放你出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一头红角龙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Crimson Goregutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他蠢爆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet it's super-dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我打不开这个笼子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I get this cage open?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是滑动门栓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It slides.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带这些龙出去！- 抓住那条夜煞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the rescues out of here! - Get that Night Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在甲板上跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No running on the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲板很滑 你会滑倒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's slippery. You could fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边站！让我来处理这个难缠的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step aside! Let me handle the tough guy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.74,0:03:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！我打倒了两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! That's two for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不！- 对不起！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no, no, no, no! - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 伙计 放了剩下的那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go, get the rest, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这是一个秘密行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this was supposed to be a stealth mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不 他们都爱这么大张旗鼓地开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they always start that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 风里飞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stop worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会处理好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,终归会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！都救出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out! We got 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要夹爆你们的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna headlock every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要夹爆你的腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might even leg-lock you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 快走！- 菜鸟们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, let's go, let's go! - Amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才刚刚开始 - 快走 伙计们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just getting started. - Clear out, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们跑了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 伙计们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good hustle, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔 该走了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless, time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总能救我于水火 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have my back, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是伯克 你们以后的新家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Berk, your new home away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们提供绝妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A stunning, one-stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一站式免费服务的梦想之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all-expense-paid dream destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 安定下来 让你的忧虑烟消云散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, settle in and let your worries melt away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的服务质量在不断提升 菜品火爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The service here soars, the cuisine is fiery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地龙和你们一样有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the locals are as colorful as you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的天堂乐园都有沙滩和阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any run-of-the-mill paradise boasts beaches and sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们可不是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有别人接触不到的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got something no one else can touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们 朋友们 我们有龙 - 让出点空间！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We, my friends, have dragons. - Make room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多很多的龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots and lots of dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 见咱们见伯克的新成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gang, meet our latest Berkians.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到天堂 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to paradise, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的家就是你的家 - 你真是个美人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our home is your home. - Well, aren't you a beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气 不用夸奖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you're welcome. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打倒大概有一百个猎龙人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took on, like, a hundred trappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对是一千个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a thousand trappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全程穿着烧着的内裤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All with burning undies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我浓密的络腮胡差点就烧着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thick full beard almost caught on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Just-just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 小嗝嗝的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, Hiccup's mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有注意到我碎骨的一击吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any notes on my bone-crushing assault,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是非常完美？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or was it pretty much perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难以描述{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was indescribable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 请叫我沃尔卡 我来这里有一年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please, call me Valka. It has been a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟人成就达成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First-name basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为今天真正的英雄是无牙仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the real hero of the day was Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有你我们可怎么办呀 龙王？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would we do without you, oh, king of dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.39,0:06:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怎么办呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,举例来说 我们可以加大训练量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could train a lot harder, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家太懒散了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was pretty sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚丝翠 说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astrid, uh, does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许大家都有点太依赖龙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you all rely a little bit too much on your dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是依赖彼此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not enough on one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？这就是我想说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? That's exactly what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听吧 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你妈妈对我印象超好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, your mom's super impressed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是她一直想要的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm like the son she always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鱼仔啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishmeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识了新朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果龙王不能维持秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good is having the king of dragons around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么留着他什么用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he can't keep the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟 你能管管吗 还是… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bud, do you want to do something here or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你想我们把他们安置在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where do you suppose we put these ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会腾出空间的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, we'll make room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们带回来一只贪噬龙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought back a Hobgobbler!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是不祥之兆 我们被诅咒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a bad omen. We're cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能有什么伤害？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What harm could he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有点吓坏了 但身体都很健康{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all a little shaken but otherwise healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.55,0:08:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who's hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是你不能总是不停把龙带回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is you can't keep bringing dragons back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是在自找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just asking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你别跑 你这个小贼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't, you little thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些猎龙人一天天的离我们越来越近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those trappers are getting closer by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能搞定的 我们有头龙呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can handle them. We have the alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是 兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他们多开心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at how happy they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太帅了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈伯 放轻松 我们办到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gobber, relax. We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上第一个龙和维京人的乌托邦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's first dragon-Viking utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让梦想照进了现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made the dream a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那是你的梦想 我的梦想可没这么拥挤 而且{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dream maybe. Mine's less crowded and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,更卫生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.49,0:09:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈伯 别自欺欺人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gobber, you're not fooling anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的 你爱他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该是带领我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be the generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走向未来的一代人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that leads us into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物大战！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,美极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心我的发型！- 乖小鱼仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch the hair! - Good, Fishmeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天啊 - 直中眉心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ugh! God help us. - Right between the eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心外部问题了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to stop worrying about problems out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈伯 - 是时候处理下眼下的事情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gobber. - and start sorting out the ones right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我会考虑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I. … I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别总骑着龙到处飞了 结婚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang up those saddles and get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "M" word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心 除非我结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross. Unless it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候像正经皇室夫妇一样统治这片土地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start ruling like a proper royal couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请 嫁给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry him, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这里唯一明事理的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one with any sense around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来当家 就还有希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you wearing the pants, there's still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈伯啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一点也不尴尬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not awkward at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚丝翠 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astrid, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明确的拒绝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. That is a definitive no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你需要胡须来擦鼻涕眼泪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you need a beard to cry on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就靠在我的肩膀上 把眼泪流进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just lean on my shoulder and you can cry into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我浓密的络腮胡里吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my full, thick beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 特夫纳特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, Tuffnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃雷 埃雷之子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eret, son of Eret!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么消息？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the report?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海峡里发现了猎龙人的两艘驳船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more trapper barges spotted in the strait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去追他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 总有一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - One day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会挑起你赢不了的战役{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna pick a fight you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,弓箭手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 屠龙人 - 保持警惕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dragon killers. - Stay on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒钳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deathgrippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！按我说的做！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back! Do what I say, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我说的做！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住拉链的另一头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the other head on that Zippleback!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong to the…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙骑士是在这里袭击我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dragon riders attacked us here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在东海峡一带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}off the Eastern Strait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷戈纳 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ragnar. - Um, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的军阀们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们征服世界的计划怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How go your plans to conquer the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛林魔 我的老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grimmel, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我了解 卓戈战败后有一年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year since Drago's defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有和你们龙军合作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no further along with your dragon army, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都归功于伯克年轻的酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank the young chief of Berk for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯多戈的儿子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stoick's boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他和他热爱和平的龙骑士们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, he and his peace-loving dragon riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断地袭击我们的船 还偷走了我们的龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}continue to raid our ships and steal our dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来确实像是个烦人的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. That does sound like a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做的是杀龙的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm in the business of killing dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没空去找龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not retrieving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 葛林魔… - 那个小蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But, Grimmel… - That idiot boy has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经帮你把事情都做好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of the work for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把龙都聚集到了一个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gathering the dragons in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,又何必来烦我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why bother me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有一只夜煞守卫着龙群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the flock is protected by a Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有一只逃出了你的手掌心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems one slipped through your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯克的龙群都听从头龙指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Berk's dragons will follow the alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.31,0:12:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们付钱给你去抓他 把龙群引过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll pay you to capture him and bring the flock to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可有你最喜欢的诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We even have your favorite bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚袭击后 他们落下的唯一一条龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only dragon they left us from last night's raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:13:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条雌的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A female? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 就这么说定了 老伙计？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do we have a deal, old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When all is said and done,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位年轻的族长会把夜煞给我送过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this young chief will bring me the Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有首领 只有一个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have a leader, just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伯克 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Berk, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的祖辈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the home of your grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和祖辈的祖辈生活的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their grandparents before them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为首领 我的职责是保护族人 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's my job as chief to protect us, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来某天 等你长大成人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day, when you're all grown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份职责将落到你身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that job will be passed on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很重要 儿子 因为那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's very important, son, because out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,落日的那头 是龙族的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond the sunset, lies the home of the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.69,0:14:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,传言靠得太近的船只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legends tell of ships that sailed too close to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会从世界的边缘坠下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to drop off the edge of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}never to be seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些返航的水手说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those sailors who turned back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一川大瀑布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}told tales of a great waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙族守卫着隐秘之地的入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dragons guarding the entrance to a Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 那里不只是一处巢穴 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Not just a nest, Hiccup,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是龙族的起源之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a land from which all dragons come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜煞也从那里来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Night Furies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是夜煞们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially Night Furies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 我会找到隐秘之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, I'll find the Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将它封闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seal it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,人族和龙族间就不会再有战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that people and dragons will fight no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这不是咬着玩的东西 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know it's not a chew toy, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩吗？你想要这条腿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you want? Oh, do you want this leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我的腿？那就接好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want my leg? Go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己滑翔得很不错嘛 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting pretty good at gliding on your own, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就是来这里躲着戈伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so this is where you come to get away from Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是对的 你要知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们应该… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you and I should…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 不是说那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gods, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没有准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're nowhere near ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 确实有点夸张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's-that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 关于这些他是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's right about all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在好像全世界都知道我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does seem like the whole world knows about us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们带回的龙越多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. And the more dragons we bring back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会成为更大的攻击目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bigger of a target we become.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.69,0:16:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我们可以不受人打扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish there was some way to make them leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸跟我讲过一个水手间流传的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad used to talk about an old mariners' myth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界的边缘有一处无人抵达的秘境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a secret land at the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙族都在那里生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where dragons live totally out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,水手们出了名地爱讲荒诞故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sailors are known for tall tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 但如果是真的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}True. But what if it's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有的问题都会迎刃而解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be the answer to all of our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做？要把龙群都迁到那里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? By moving the dragons there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都迁过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh. All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样抛弃我们生活了七代的家园？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And abandon our home of seven generations?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片你父亲留给你守护的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The home your father left you to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们需要一个切实的办法 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think we need a real solution, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以听戈伯的建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could just take Gobber's advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,缔结连理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tie the knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样所有问题都解决了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果你对在下还有什么不称心的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, if you're having doubts about yours truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻涕虫可还是单身呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure Snotlout's available.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他眼里只有你妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only has eyes for your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耍招数呢？- 是你先招惹我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Playing dirty now, huh? - You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来总要举办一场婚礼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there might be a wedding after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好大胆 这么龌蹉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how dare you? That is a low blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你跑不掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you are not getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 你赢了 你赢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, you win, you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是你赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早知道会是这个下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew what you were getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.40,0:17:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么… 当然 不用费心等我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… Yeah, sure, don't bother to wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 我们是朋友 没必要杀我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, w-we're friends. No need to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 另一只夜煞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Another Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 也不是 倒像一只…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not quite. It's more like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亮… 煞 - 一只光煞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bright… Fury. - A Light Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的更恰当一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yours is better, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说消失是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭空就不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanished, into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看怎么样？- 不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think? - Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵要短一些 没有背甲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stubbier ears. No dorsal plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一晚上真够忙活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你这是怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bud, what's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,又流口水又喘气？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all this slobbering and panting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不明显吗？他恋爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious? He's in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 爱情只会带来痛苦和悲伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, relationships are nothing but pain and misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才说什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我还不够吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-Am I not enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是不太够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是这个样子吗？- 要不这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something like this? - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,按无牙仔卡片临摹一张 换成白色的就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trace your Toothless card and make her white.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早说不就好了 - 你敢信吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could've led with that. - Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔有女朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless has a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.23,0:21:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得你是个爱浪漫的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never took you for a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这太甜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太可悲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有点怪异 - 你还是做点什么好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And weird. - Yeah, you better do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话？我宁愿每天铲便便也不想看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously? I'd rather shovel poop all day than watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们回头去树林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's head back to the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see if we can find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,借一步说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 男人间的谈话 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's boy talk. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们谈一下这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你想结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 我去过两次婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news. I've been to two weddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.77,0:22:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是不请自来 但是都没这次的规格高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I crashed both, but none as high profile as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,压力很大 还要担心别人的看法 不仅仅是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of pressure, judgment, and not just by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过了 我们暂时不会结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we talked about it. We're not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕了 这种情况我见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold feet. I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 小嗝子 有我在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Little Hiccy. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 小嗝子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Hiccy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.15,0:22:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道亚丝翠是怎么看你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've seen the way Astrid looks at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都是 有一些怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has. That doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.69,0:22:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种有点强烈的失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That not so subtle disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你高高的期盼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That longing for something more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要变得优秀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to focus on being worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她是皇后又是个女战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's a warrior queen, for Thor's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.03,0:22:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却一样也不占{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我来做你伴郎…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with me as your best man…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你精神指引 如果你能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your spirit guide, if you will…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.41,0:22:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能重拾维京之魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll learn to embrace your inner Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.41,0:22:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这些为数不少的反对者们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show these naysayers, of which there are many,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 你才不是一头营养不良{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're more than just a malnourished runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.85,0:22:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发质糟糕 长一口怪牙 脖子细弱的小家牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with bad hair, strange teeth, and a twig for a neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.45,0:22:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你真不会聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're-you're really bad at pep talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让这些弱点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop letting these insecurities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:22:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止你变得优秀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}get the best of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.99,0:23:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都看着你呢 真的 每个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's watching. I mean, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.16,0:23:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要更男人一点 照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to man up. Do as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有点难 但我会帮助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be hard, but you have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃的 除非我食言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And until I break that word, I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！怎么回事 我都白说了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What, am I wasting my time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在树林里看见什么发光的玩意儿… 这是啥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see some shiny thing in the woods… Ooh, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来过了 - 哈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone's here. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绕过了我们的巡查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He managed to slip past our scouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在树林里设下了陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lay a trap in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的谈话都毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ruined boy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.21,0:23:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去抓他！- 慢着 戈伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gah, let me at him! - Slow down, Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.48,0:23:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派一支队伍在地上搜查 空中再派人侦察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a search team on the ground, scouts in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.31,0:23:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔和我巡查海岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless and I will fly the coastline.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不建议带无牙仔出任务 酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wouldn't advise taking Toothless anywhere, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.32,0:24:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识这东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.49,0:24:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,奸猾葛林魔 在我们那他很出名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grimmel the Grisly. Famous back where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我见过的最狡猾的猎龙高手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smartest dragon hunter I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.13,0:24:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 在我之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, next to me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.23,0:24:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没那么聪明 他只留下一个没人管的陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he can't be that smart. He left his trap unmanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.43,0:24:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老葛林魔从来都是机关用尽 不露痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's accidental when it comes to old Grimmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.77,0:24:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以猎龙为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives for the hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,能懂得猎物的想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get inside the mind of his prey,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制他们的行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to control its every choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.91,0:24:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说 这不过是一场游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a game to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.48,0:24:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道他惹上谁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he doesn't know who he's playing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们之前对付过他这种人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, we've dealt with his kind before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.41,0:24:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别小瞧他 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't underestimate him, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.45,0:24:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的话 他还会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark my words. He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.19,0:24:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就等着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll be waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.54,0:24:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 给我个线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on, give me a clue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.94,0:24:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个提示 老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a clue, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.06,0:25:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你原谅我自便了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hope you don't mind if I help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这茶不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh, mmm, quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.57,0:25:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器不错 但先让我喝完这杯茶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is impressive. But let me finish my drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.98,0:25:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.32,0:25:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是让他睡个好觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, nothing that he won't sleep off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以坐下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.86,0:25:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.99,0:25:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该叫你酋长呢还是小嗝嗝呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Do I say Chief or do I call you Hiccup?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.03,0:25:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢哪一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.10,0:26:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我是谁 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea who I am, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.87,0:26:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲认识我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your father knew of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.11,0:26:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一位伟大的酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there was a chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.01,0:26:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是有史以来最伟大的猎龙人之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the greatest dragon hunters to have ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他还在 又会如何看待你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would he think of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.62,0:26:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had it right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,担起了打败恶兽的重任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making it his mission to destroy the beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.33,0:26:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才能在这个更好的世界里长大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that you could grow up in a better world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.59,0:26:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他改变主意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He changed his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他最后的下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look where that got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.43,0:26:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是说重点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜煞猎手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Night Fury killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经杀了所有的夜煞 除了你那一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hunted every last one but yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.91,0:26:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给我 不然…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to give me that dragon, or I will…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.51,0:26:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会把他交给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never give him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.58,0:26:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望龙和人一样自由平等的生活在一起？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish dragons to live free among us like equals?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.29,0:26:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险的想法 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toxic notion, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:27:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史已经证明了我们才是最高贵的种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}History has shown that we are the superior species.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.13,0:27:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这种错误的想法广为传播 后果该如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if word of your misguided ideas were to spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.60,0:27:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类文明将走上毁灭之路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be the undoing of civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如我们所知的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.01,0:27:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓住他了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.42,0:27:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.52,0:27:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我闯了进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你可以就这样闯进我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can come into my home,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在我父亲的椅子上 威胁要抓我的龙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sit in my father's chair, and threaten my dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是伯克岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Berk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.17,0:27:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这一路来打败的坏蛋可比你厉害多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have defended our way of life from far worse than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗精神 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fighting spirit. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.37,0:27:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你好像犯了个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only I'm afraid you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.71,0:27:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的那些坏蛋和我还差得远呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never seen anything like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚丝翠 小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astrid, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.73,0:28:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！孩子 躲开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Son, get clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.34,0:28:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下次来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have my dragon ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.65,0:28:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的夜煞准备好 不然我会毁掉你爱的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I return, or I will destroy everything you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.26,0:28:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿上水桶！- 怎么会发生这种事？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab the buckets! - How did this happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.03,0:28:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进去 - 大半夜什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inside. - It's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.03,0:28:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我们来这干什么？- 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we doing here? - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.30,0:28:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 稍安勿躁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody. Settle down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.21,0:28:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼脚司啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishlegs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.11,0:28:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前见过那个品种的龙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen that species of dragon before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:28:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来对付他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好招待他的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give him a piece of my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 用拳头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by mind, I mean fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是忘了我们差点就没命了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss the part where we almost died?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.62,0:29:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我的房子了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.26,0:29:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个前所未有的强敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a new kind of enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.73,0:29:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我小瞧了他 这是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I underestimated him. Now, that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会再犯同样的错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will not do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是维京人 我们可不怕打架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're Vikings. We don't run from a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.64,0:29:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我不会 你倒是不一定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, I don't. You might.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我支持小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.61,0:29:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛林魔的手段可不止这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen the last of Grimmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.61,0:29:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是猎龙人 固执又有耐心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a predator, single-minded and patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得到猎物绝不罢休{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't stop until he gets what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.68,0:29:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意埃雷的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with Eret.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.78,0:29:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须谨慎对待这次危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to take this threat seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.78,0:29:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛林魔只是反对势力的代表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grimmel is just a sign of the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.79,0:29:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的敌人变得更聪明也更坚定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our enemies are getting smarter, more determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的岛不仅是越来越拥挤 还容易暴露 易受攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not just overcrowded. We are exposed and vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.66,0:29:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面开战对我们很不利 甚至要赌上所爱之人的性命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short of full-blown war and risking everyone we love,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.53,0:29:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得继续留在这已经没有意义了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see a way of staying here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果斯多戈在世 他会怎么想？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Stoick think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.64,0:29:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他把话说完！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hear him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.28,0:30:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果大家想平静地和龙生活在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we want to live in peace with our dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.62,0:30:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个更好的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need a better plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.65,0:30:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想说什么 酋长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you saying, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.36,0:30:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我们该消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying we have to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.52,0:30:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这地图上消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.46,0:30:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着龙去一个谁也找不到的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the dragons to a place where no one will find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.70,0:30:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会在哪呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.70,0:30:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是隐秘之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking about a quest for the Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.53,0:30:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐秘什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hidden what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.40,0:30:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 疯了吧 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out to lunch. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候我父亲就一直有这个想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was obsessed with it when I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.54,0:30:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在寻找龙族起源地的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made notes and maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.31,0:30:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他留下了笔记和地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in search of the ancestral home of all dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.15,0:30:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐秘之地就在世界边缘的某处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tucked away somewhere beyond the edge of the world. The Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.38,0:30:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也许是我们需要的解决方案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be the solution we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.52,0:30:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是驯龙人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are dragon people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.35,0:30:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们属于那个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where we belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.46,0:30:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这里是我们的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this is our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.46,0:30:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲让我留下保护这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father left me to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.23,0:30:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但伯克不止是一个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Berk is more than this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.23,0:30:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是伯克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Berk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.17,0:31:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 龙族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people, the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.80,0:31:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪 那里就是伯克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say Berk is wherever we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.57,0:31:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.91,0:31:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.28,0:31:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我支持他！还有谁？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with him! Who else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.36,0:31:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 借过一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.77,0:31:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, let me just get right through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.87,0:31:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鱼仔 看 吃小石头 吃石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishmeat, look, eat your rocks. Eat your rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.71,0:31:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 带着孩子飞的人最糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods! People who fly with babies are the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.38,0:31:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉我一直在问你这个问题 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm always asking you this question, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.95,0:31:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 格拉姆！醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Grump! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.95,0:31:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的有计划还是… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there an actual plan or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.35,0:31:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直往前飞到世界的尽头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep flying until we reach the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.45,0:31:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来有点道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Seems sensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.73,0:31:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone. Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.66,0:32:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只夜煞从你手里逃走了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Night Fury escaped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.80,0:32:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又逃走了？- 我故意放他们走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again? - I encouraged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.97,0:32:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放弃了唯一的庇护所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've abandoned their only defensible position.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.40,0:32:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,仓皇而逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.00,0:32:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只带了一丁点行李{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with what little they can carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.41,0:32:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么还没到头啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just keeps going.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.31,0:32:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为这世界是圆的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause the world is actually round.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.01,0:32:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳是圆的 月亮是圆的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's round. The moon is round.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.61,0:32:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星是圆的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stars are round.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.98,0:32:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他们看起来又小又笨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though they're small and stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？星星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.85,0:32:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他们跑不远的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fret. They won't get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.02,0:32:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条夜煞心烦意乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Night Fury is distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他介绍给你们的小母龙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I introduced him to your female.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜煞对伴侣都忠贞不渝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furies mate for life, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现什么了 兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you picking up on, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.97,0:32:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条光煞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Light Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.47,0:32:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直跟着我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's following us!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.91,0:32:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了吗？- 她去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would ya look at that? - Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hold up, Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.62,0:33:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那是谁啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.73,0:33:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴 我们终于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, it's really nice to finally…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.84,0:33:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真带劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is perfect. So great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.71,0:33:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧好吧 他们到底去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-Yes, yes, but where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.68,0:33:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得解释一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.32,0:33:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜煞不能抵御寒冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night Furies can't survive in the cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.99,0:33:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以肯定不是北方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they haven't gone north.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.22,0:33:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要离敌人越远越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to put distance between themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.32,0:33:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而敌人在东方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and enemies to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.69,0:33:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,和南方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and south.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.03,0:33:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜煞不能不休息地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Night Furies cannot fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.86,0:33:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,长途飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}long distances without rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.60,0:33:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以中途必须找地方休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their flight path must include stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.07,0:33:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potty break!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.37,0:33:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 他们去了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, they've gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.11,0:33:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只能去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can only have gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.95,0:34:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想猜一下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone want to take a guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.85,0:34:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,夕… 希…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-W. … W-W-W…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.85,0:34:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 东方！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, east!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.99,0:34:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}West.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.73,0:34:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这么简单 看到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Simple, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.56,0:34:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很好玩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, isn't this fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.56,0:34:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩吧？不好玩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩 好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.70,0:34:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对猎龙的热爱呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your love of the hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.04,0:34:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是征服者吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were conquerors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.57,0:34:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定会收获颇丰的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have your prize in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.78,0:34:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我再多享受几天吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just allow me a few more days to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.75,0:34:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很怀念这种感觉呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have dearly missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.75,0:34:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.39,0:34:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们今晚要在这儿扎营了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're camping here for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.55,0:34:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 真是谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank Thor for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. My own place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.53,0:34:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要造个小屋 只给有胡子的人住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I plan to build a hut, only for the bearded.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.90,0:34:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉芙纳特 你得呆在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruffnut, you got to stay out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.76,0:34:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,下巴上长的胡子不能算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin whiskers don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了我体内的男子气概{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a tower of manliness in the shape of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.77,0:34:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比埃雷还高 肌肉也比他强壮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be taller than Eret with bigger muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.01,0:34:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:34:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出我的房子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.64,0:35:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们之间有梁子吗？- 对 有梁子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a problem here? - Yeah, there's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.68,0:35:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你出现之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.98,0:35:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一直抢我的风头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been trying to upstage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.55,0:35:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嫉妒心太强了 别妄想了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just so jealous. It's delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.75,0:35:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 妄想这个词很恰当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, delusion's a good word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.65,0:35:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 埃雷之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, son of Eret.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.19,0:35:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝是酋长 我就是他的接班人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Hiccup blows it as chief, I'm next in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.62,0:35:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,二当家 因为沃尔卡最喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number two, 'cause I'm clearly Valka's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你最好现在开始对我放尊重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you better start showing me some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.13,0:35:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的小矮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用搭理他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, don't mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.43,0:35:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有神祗般完美的身材又不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault you have the body of a Norse god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.77,0:35:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也有同样的困扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I myself have the same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.01,0:35:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁匠铺就选在这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blacksmith's stall goes right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.64,0:35:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.01,0:35:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's…?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.65,0:35:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家等一下 我… 说的是扎营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hold on, gang. I. … I said make camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.05,0:35:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到他们了吗？- 不是造个新镇子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see them? - Not build a new village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.12,0:35:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁升了天 让你当了酋长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who died and made you chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.02,0:35:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？疼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.69,0:35:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然 这地方非常不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted, this place is very nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.03,0:35:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不是隐秘之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not the Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道它存不存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if this Hidden World exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.20,0:36:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这地方却是实实在在的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This place is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么人能比一群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, there's nothing more stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.24,0:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,又累又饿的维京人更固执{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a mob of tired, hungry Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以暂时把这里当做基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess this can work as a base in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.91,0:36:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里利于防守 也很隐秘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's defensible, hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们可以留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.22,0:36:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,和新伯克打声招呼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to New Berk!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.95,0:36:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家动手造起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get building, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.82,0:36:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我和无牙仔找到隐秘之地就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Toothless and I find the Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.22,0:36:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再瞎想了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.76,0:36:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说你的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, about that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.23,0:36:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能别说话像鹅叫一样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we lose the whole honking goose thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.70,0:36:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你婚礼上面时不时发出鹅叫声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to imagine wedded bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.93,0:36:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是有好戏看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that going off every minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.87,0:36:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还要继续向西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're going to continue west,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.74,0:36:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该往回巡逻一下 以防被跟踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should head back to make sure we weren't followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.04,0:36:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 我和你一起去 保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great idea. I'll go with you for protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用！你留在这里比较重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You're far too important here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.91,0:36:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.18,0:36:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.15,0:36:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这地方！太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place! It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.65,0:36:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那块石头不错 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a nice rock. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.55,0:36:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个让我们隐藏起来的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This plan to hide us from the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.82,0:36:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然… 虽然我真心希望它可行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though… though I wish it were possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.73,0:36:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕会撑不了多久 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear it can't last, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.26,0:37:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说这么多年来 我也在努力做同样的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know I tried to do the same for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.03,0:37:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可贪婪的人类总能钻到空子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But greedy humans always find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是… 只是想让你再深思熟虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I only ask that you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.74,0:37:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.07,0:37:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我先把斧子扎在这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw my axe down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.04,0:37:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还觉得我太疯狂了吗… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still think I'm crazy or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.68,0:37:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 这整个计划很有你的风格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say this whole idea is very you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你昨晚支持我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for supporting me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.25,0:37:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我意义重大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It meant a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.79,0:37:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别急着谢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.32,0:37:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望你的计划是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope you're right about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.29,0:37:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这里 - 我一直很想要个能看日落的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like it here. - I always wanted a sunset view.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.65,0:37:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔 别吵 现在太早了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless. No, it's too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.48,0:43:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你倒是会画画了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now you can draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.59,0:44:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来你根本没睡呀 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Someone hasn't slept. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.63,0:44:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只光煞不会让我靠近到一英里以内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that Light Fury won't let me within a mile of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.10,0:44:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在无牙仔泡上妞之前 我俩都没法睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither of us will be getting any sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.10,0:44:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提去找什么隐秘之地了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or finding the Hidden World until Toothless takes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.74,0:44:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.41,0:44:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.57,0:45:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.51,0:45:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前也试过一次 但他不想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried this once before. He didn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.68,0:45:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为以前他没有特殊的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, until now, he didn't have a reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.15,0:45:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 哥们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.62,0:45:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.63,0:45:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我只是很欣慰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing. I'm… I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.60,0:45:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 竟然愿意接受改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you. Embracing change.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.50,0:45:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很为你自豪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.50,0:45:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最好的哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's my best bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.50,0:45:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让他开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.51,0:45:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且等他把妞带回来 就不需要这个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, besides, it's just until he brings her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.81,0:45:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.61,0:45:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发个火球 - 哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire when ready. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.22,0:45:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概早知道那尾巴是防火的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess you know the tail is fireproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.49,0:45:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 无牙仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.23,0:45:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了 别闹 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Okay, yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.06,0:45:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.56,0:45:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.07,0:46:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 不然我装不好 - 看看 看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, this is not helping. - Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.40,0:46:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好兴奋呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚经历了第一次约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fresh off his first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.57,0:46:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他眼里只有爱情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's love crazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.54,0:46:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,留我们在这里发疯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only we're the ones going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越快能把光煞带回来越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner he brings back that Light Fury, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.11,0:46:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想带她回来 他得单独飞行才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but to do that, he'll need to fly without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.38,0:46:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是时候试试这个改良版的新玩意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So time to give this new and improved baby a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.15,0:46:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 你看上去帅极了 无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy. Looking sharp, Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.72,0:46:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样 哥们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.29,0:46:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.69,0:46:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,得在太阳下山前回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By sundown at the latest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.86,0:46:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹 精力留给你女朋友吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, save it for your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.37,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 赶紧去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.34,0:46:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.44,0:47:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.38,0:47:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 云中跃！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Cloudjumper!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.63,0:51:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬酋长！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.54,0:51:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬酋长！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.84,0:51:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 敬酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. To our chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.11,0:51:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是你父亲的翻版{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a chip off the old block.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.14,0:51:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抛了 各位 我感觉有点想吐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, guys. Now I'm just getting sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.11,0:51:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.88,0:51:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.78,0:51:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前还以为你是在瞎胡闹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were well off your rocker,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.62,0:51:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这地方还是不赖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this spot ain't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.79,0:51:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只是一个暂时的基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was supposed to be a temporary solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.66,0:51:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没异议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unanimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.62,0:51:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都觉得这地方比原先的更棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone agrees we've definitely traded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.39,0:51:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一尾巴坏了怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the tail broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.43,0:51:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一葛林魔找到他了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Grimmel found him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.03,0:51:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 万一他需要我呢？- 放轻松 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if he needs me? - Would you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.63,0:51:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他就是在享受龙生最美好的时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably having the time of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.80,0:51:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道？她从来不接近我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would I know? She never comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.04,0:51:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次来了 也都会匆匆飞走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when she does, she's always rushing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.51,0:51:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想说… 我们怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying how… how do we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.94,0:51:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她适合和我们一起住呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she's right for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.61,0:51:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们？- 你懂我的意思吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Us? - You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.61,0:51:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太野性也太狡猾 这么说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so wild and skittish. I'm just gonna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.48,0:51:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.65,0:51:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法驯服所有龙 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't tame 'em all, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.46,0:51:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你得把那些牵绊都给剪断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, you'll have to snip those apron strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.96,0:51:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让无牙仔自己翱翔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let Toothless stretch his wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.13,0:52:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我想起了我和斯多戈上次聊你的时候说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reminds me of a talk I had with Stoick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.50,0:52:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是从哪里来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do they keep coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.43,0:52:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 那些可怕的贪噬龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Those bloody Hobgobblers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.00,0:52:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌他们比兔子生得还要快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear they're popping up faster than rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.64,0:52:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们是想吃了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they want to eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.64,0:52:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有证据显示我很好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidence would suggest I'm tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.84,0:52:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝子 你有空吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiccy, a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.51,0:52:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我一直在观察你的走路姿势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've been watching you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.51,0:52:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一瘸一拐的 新娘不会喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the limp. No one's gonna marry that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.58,0:52:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我这条是假腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a prosthetic leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.45,0:52:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的也是 - 我还有个寄生双胞胎呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So have I. - And I have a parasitic twin,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.62,0:52:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你也没见我一瘸一拐到处走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't see me limping around about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 抬头 小嗝子 挺胸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Chin up, Hiccy. Puff out that chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.03,0:52:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,胯往左边再多摆一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move that butt to the left a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.80,0:52:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你受伤了？外面出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, are you hurt? W. … What happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.57,0:52:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道葛林魔用了什么办法 但他在跟踪我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how, but Grimmel is tracking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.84,0:52:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！这一切肯定都是贪噬龙的锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! This is all because of the Hobgobblers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.71,0:52:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一百艘船 可能更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a hundred ships, maybe more,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.81,0:52:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有足够装下我们这些龙的笼子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with enough cages for all of our dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.15,0:52:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果葛林魔带船队来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Grimmel is leading them here,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.85,0:53:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要干掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to take him out of the mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.92,0:53:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么干掉他呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, and how would we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去船上抓他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By going there to capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capture him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.93,0:53:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入！还有人来吗？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with him! Who else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.55,0:54:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们分开走 就不容易被抓到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, split up. We'll be harder to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.25,0:54:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该分开走 这是我的直觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking we should split up, just because.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.82,0:54:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的直觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.05,0:54:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.89,0:54:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！嘘！别出声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Shh! Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.76,0:54:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别出声 - 你需要你的龙的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quiet. - Where's your dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.33,0:54:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑去哪儿了呢 酋长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you need him, hmm, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.27,0:54:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是把你们都忘了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have forgotten all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.87,0:54:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,狩猎的第一要则：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First rule of the hunt:
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.94,0:55:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把猎物从群落里引出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separate the prey from its pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.38,0:55:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚才自动退出了这场游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just removed yourselves from the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.38,0:55:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要这么做？- 你真要问这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you doing this? - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.28,0:55:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你不在乎呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你不一样 我小的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, unlike you, when I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.85,0:55:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到过一只夜煞 我趁它睡觉的时候杀了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I came upon a Night Fury, I killed it where it slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.92,0:55:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这勇气之举让我成为了村子的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That simple act of courage made me a hero in my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.36,0:55:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定要杀光它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I decided to kill every last one,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.90,0:55:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这个世界的人们带来真正的和平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bringing real peace to the people of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.37,0:55:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you came along,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.37,0:55:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处宣扬那些龙不是小偷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}preaching that dragons are something other than.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.64,0:55:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是杀人的动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thieves and murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.15,0:55:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这狗屁理论现在就要完蛋了 就从杀了你开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That nonsense dies now, starting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.68,0:55:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你自己也有龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have dragons of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.98,0:55:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.09,0:55:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是用来杀龙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dragon killers,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.09,0:55:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自己的毒液让他们服从我的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drugged into obedience with their own venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.36,0:55:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你那只宝贝头龙都没法控制他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your precious alpha could control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.69,0:55:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只只听命于我一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They serve me and only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.03,0:55:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来示范给你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.40,0:56:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.37,0:56:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.78,0:56:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.70,0:56:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.15,0:56:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.02,0:56:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑 跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.99,0:57:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.50,0:57:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.17,0:57:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 云中跃！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Cloudjumper!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.14,0:57:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒呆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.14,0:57:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的英雄！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.26,0:57:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿都带着那只愚蠢的龙宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, he takes that stupid baby everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.37,0:57:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God almighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.07,0:57:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这个笼子是用不上了 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we won't be needing this then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.00,0:57:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带人正中了他的圈套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I led us right into his trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.27,0:57:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是干得棒 酋长 对吧 拉芙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nice work, Chief. Right, Ruff?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.48,0:57:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.01,0:57:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃… - 拉芙纳特在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… - Where is Ruffnut?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.48,0:57:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们… 没带上她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we left her behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.35,0:57:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没发现她不见了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you not notice she was missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.38,0:57:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这龙另一只脑袋上没人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ride a two-headed dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.22,0:57:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.39,0:58:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我和拉芙纳特一样蠢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like how Ruffnut is every day: dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.49,0:58:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁都要气跳脚了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin be spanked!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.32,0:58:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事情越来越乱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just gets better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.43,0:58:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么好消息吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more fantastic news?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.96,0:58:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般都尽量不去看她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to avoid looking at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.30,0:58:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然会让我恶心反胃酸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives me acid reflux.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.83,0:58:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 兄弟们 把头盔带上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-Okay, guys, just keep your helmets on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.03,0:58:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和无牙仔去找她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless and I will find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.50,0:58:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔现在已经有了光煞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless has the Light Fury now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.44,0:58:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能都不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably not even coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.21,0:58:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.44,0:58:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他自由了 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave him his freedom, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you expecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.34,0:58:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过他永远不回来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought he'd stay away for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.21,0:58:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I. …
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.95,0:58:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弄明白 我只是需要一点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll-I'll figure it out. I just need more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.95,0:58:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得他要一个人扛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks he has to lead alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.89,0:58:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他父亲是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because his father had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.43,0:58:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有意识到你们俩的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't realize the strength you have together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.03,0:58:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在还信任他吗？- 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you still believe in him? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.43,0:58:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他也信任自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.23,0:58:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他觉得自己没有无牙仔就一无是处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he thinks he's nothing without Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.61,0:58:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就帮他认清事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then help him realize the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.91,0:59:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上来 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get on. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.08,0:59:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.32,0:59:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.55,0:59:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家留在原地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.86,0:59:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把拉芙纳特找回来 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will get Ruffnut back. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.56,0:59:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.23,0:59:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们被拉芙纳特缠上了 我更担心他们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're stuck with Ruffnut, I'm more worried about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.93,0:59:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你的脸那么长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.43,0:59:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脸算长了 但是你的脸才真的长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, mine's long, but yours is really long.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.50,0:59:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,头上没脑子 只剩脸 仿佛出生时被拉长了一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All face and no brain, like you got stretched at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.27,0:59:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是也有个双胞胎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a twin, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.87,0:59:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,特夫纳特把妈妈肚子里的空间都占了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuffnut took up all the room in Mom's belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.61,0:59:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我的脸就会更圆 也有更多脑髓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise I'd have a rounder head and more brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是科学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's science.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.61,0:59:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的辫子就像小双头龙 看到没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My braids are like little Zipplebacks. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.02,0:59:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的霉点看着像眼睛 真可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the mold spots look like eyes. It's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.39,0:59:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甚至还有小角 什么都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They even have little horns and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.09,0:59:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像巴夫和贝尔奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like Barf and Belch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.42,0:59:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我和巴夫受不了贝尔奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except me and Barf can't stand Belch,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们其实就是巴夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they're really just Barfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.32,0:59:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's warm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.39,0:59:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.56,0:59:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没见过我这么性感的囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never had a prisoner this hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.36,0:59:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有男孩都爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the boys love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.17,0:59:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了埃雷以外 他完全没机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except Eret, who totally lost his chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.30,0:59:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙 船已启航啦 对不起啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ship has sailed, boy. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.34,0:59:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而小嗝嗝呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Hiccup is practically married.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.67,0:59:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎已经和那个圆脑袋亚丝翠结婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to that round-head, Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.84,1:00:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是鼻涕虫和鱼脚司 他们基本就算我的后宫了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Snotlout and Fishlegs, they're basically my harem.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.21,1:00:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是没法选 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't choose, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.61,1:00:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻涕虫很健壮 但是长得太帅了 知道吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snotlout's a beefcake but almost too pretty, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.21,1:00:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我觉得他更爱他自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I think he's more in love with himself than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.55,1:00:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恋爱中 只容得下一个好看的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only room for one beauty in this relationship.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.92,1:00:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果困在冰川 我非得吃一个的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishlegs would keep me alive longer if I had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.49,1:00:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼脚司可以让我活更久一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}eat one of them, stranded on some glacier somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.32,1:00:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他张口就是龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he never shuts up about dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.13,1:00:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人不停说话的时候 你会不会讨厌呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you hate when people never stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.53,1:00:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 很讨厌 - 他们不停地说啊说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. - They just keep going and going.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.43,1:00:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,满嘴废话 无聊透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah. It's so boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.93,1:00:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能直接把她喂龙吃吗？- 我饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't we just feed her to your dragons? - I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.94,1:00:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你有什么吃的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what do you have to eat around here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.34,1:00:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你说一下 我对鱼过敏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm allergic to fish. You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.60,1:00:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个新的蠢岛上 除了鱼什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all they have at that stupid new island.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.94,1:00:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有蛤可以吃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any clams?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.51,1:00:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就像小嘴巴 里面有黏黏的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like little mouths with slimy food inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.34,1:00:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物都被咀嚼过了 就像我妈的做法一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's already chewed, like the way Mom used to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.45,1:00:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.62,1:00:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了12岁 我妈就说 「该自己嚼食物啦」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I turned 12 and she was like, "Chew your own food."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.05,1:00:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 「才不要 我就喜欢这样」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was like, "No, I kinda like it."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.62,1:00:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没见过这么烦人的玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most annoying creature ever to cross my path.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.16,1:00:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦 你把龙放出来啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops, you let the dragons out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.26,1:00:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来抓你啦 我来抓你啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you. I'm gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.13,1:00:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 这只来抓你 - 快…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, this one's gonna get you. - Get…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.96,1:00:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him and go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.30,1:01:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了！我求你啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.04,1:01:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒钳只能少一顿晚餐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Deathgrippers will have to forgo dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.44,1:01:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心 你把龙拿去喂龙吃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew, you feed your dragons dragons?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.71,1:01:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走！- 你厕所在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Where's your bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.01,1:01:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.11,1:01:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦！天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.41,1:01:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你头发都灰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you have gray hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.48,1:01:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,压力太大对你可不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stress is not good for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.22,1:01:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜啦 失败者！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, losers!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.07,1:01:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要去哪里啊？- 她在跟踪什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where，where is she heading? - She's tracking something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.70,1:01:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 乖乖？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you, girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.64,1:01:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有 只有数英里的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing but miles and miles of…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.17,1:02:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个巨型瀑布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.31,1:02:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界尽头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.61,1:02:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,风里飞啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.30,1:03:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.45,1:04:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really does exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.37,1:04:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无牙仔 - 嘘 你会吓到他们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Toothless. - Shh. You'll spook them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.55,1:05:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是真王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.36,1:06:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.63,1:06:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.74,1:06:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,风里飞啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormfly!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.82,1:07:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.64,1:07:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 对不起 伙计 我 我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm sorry, bud. I-I just…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.60,1:07:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.90,1:07:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该在睡觉啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.57,1:07:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我口渴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.98,1:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 过来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.96,1:08:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.39,1:08:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会给我们找个新妈妈吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna get us a new mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.00,1:08:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want another.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.73,1:08:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈是我唯一的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom was the only woman for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.97,1:08:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我一生的挚爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.57,1:08:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有爱就有失去 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with love comes loss, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.78,1:08:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.65,1:08:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时会疼 但最终 这都是值得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it hurts, but in the end, it's all worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.09,1:08:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱是最伟大的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no greater gift than love.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.87,1:09:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.14,1:09:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于那里 和她在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong there, with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.24,1:09:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不属于那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.11,1:09:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.55,1:09:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想办法去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to man…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.03,1:09:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.86,1:09:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟我们回来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She followed us back!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.94,1:09:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们不用告别呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might not have to say good-bye after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.55,1:10:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.88,1:10:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呼！耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo-hoo! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.68,1:10:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉芙纳特？- 想我了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ruffnut? - Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.72,1:10:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃出来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you escape?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.19,1:10:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被我烦死了 结果只好放我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I annoyed them till they let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.92,1:10:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.59,1:10:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 葛林魔让你走了？- 太蠢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grimmel let you go? - So dumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.69,1:10:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们受不了我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They couldn't handle me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.69,1:10:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 每个人都觉得特夫纳特更烦人 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, everyone thinks Tuffnut's more annoying, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.70,1:10:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 等一下 - 拉芙纳特 专心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, hold on. - Ruffnut, focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.00,1:10:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟踪你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you followed?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.87,1:10:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可从不回头 小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never look back, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.94,1:10:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.04,1:10:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.69,1:10:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔 回来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless, come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.93,1:10:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.91,1:11:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小游戏必须结束啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now our little game must come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.02,1:11:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们停下 头龙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call them off, alpha!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.89,1:11:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要让她也死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason for her to die, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.91,1:11:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.18,1:11:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们完全可以搞定他的 - 她现在命悬一线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They could totally take him. - Not with her life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.12,1:11:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别费劲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.68,1:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我才是他们的头龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only alpha they respond to is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.89,1:12:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太难过 你尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't feel too badly. You tried your best.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.80,1:12:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有龙 你一无是处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are nothing without your dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.78,1:12:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.07,1:12:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这下好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is just great!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.31,1:12:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.47,1:12:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得该让老二当老大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time for number two to become number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.04,1:12:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会听你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.98,1:12:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说了 - 我没这打算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't say it. - I wasn't going to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.25,1:13:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该把你拉到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have dragged you out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.99,1:13:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会送我回来 她就不会跟着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't have flown me back. She wouldn't have followed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.22,1:13:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.22,1:13:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我就和遇见无牙仔时一样 一团糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like the same screwup I was before I met Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.19,1:13:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我看得出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.03,1:13:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就打算站在那 同意我说的话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you just gonna stand there and agree with everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.20,1:13:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.03,1:13:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回到了原点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back to where you started,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.87,1:13:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是第一个相信你的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was the first to believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.21,1:13:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都看着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have watched you doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.91,1:13:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀疑自己是否值得相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you're worthy ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.38,1:13:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.21,1:13:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 我才成了现在的自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the person I am today because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.08,1:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没告诉你 但这是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told you that, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.15,1:13:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最勇敢 最固执{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the bravest, most stubborn,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.85,1:13:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最坚定的傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}most determined knucklehead I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.86,1:13:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小嗝嗝 这不是无牙仔给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless didn't give you that, Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.13,1:13:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他只是让它变得… - 更容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He just made it… - Easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.46,1:13:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 会难得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's gonna be a lot harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.07,1:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.50,1:13:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能做些傻事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.24,1:13:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我认识的小嗝嗝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Hiccup I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.11,1:14:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 穿上装备 我们去把他们找回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit up, gang. We're going to get them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.02,1:14:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.02,1:14:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 才像是结婚的料子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's marriage material.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.12,1:14:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于 忠诚的学生 你准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last, faithful pupil, you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.36,1:14:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没有龙 我们怎么把龙救出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, how are we gonna get our dragons back without dragons?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.53,1:14:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.50,1:14:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当心 - 下一个是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch yourselves. - You're next.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.54,1:14:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 头龙 做得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, that's right, alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.05,1:14:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别制造惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.39,1:14:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着这些跳下悬崖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, jump off the cliff in these.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.96,1:14:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你最好的打算？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the best you've got?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.46,1:14:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们才是我最好的打算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you guys are the best I've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.53,1:14:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我支持他！还有谁？- 我支持…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm with him! Who else? - I'm with…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.30,1:14:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉芙纳特 那是我的台词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruffnut, that was my line.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.34,1:15:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧！- 大家跟上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Try to keep up!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.05,1:15:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也来了！- 真棒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm doing it! - All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.82,1:15:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.19,1:15:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会以为我真会把夜煞交给你们吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I'd actually hand you the Night Fury,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.36,1:15:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.36,1:15:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须死在我手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.07,1:15:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个狡猾的家伙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That snake!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.87,1:15:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把我的使命完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to finish what I started.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.57,1:15:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有头龙的情况下想要控制住其他龙 你们就自求多福吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best of luck controlling them without an alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.91,1:15:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.61,1:15:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.98,1:15:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该事先训练一下的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've used some practice!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.48,1:15:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我不该吃早饭的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I should've skipped breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.96,1:15:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.57,1:16:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.97,1:16:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫 好烫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.91,1:16:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙都逃出来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.12,1:16:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机完美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器！- 我来解决那个皮包骨头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put that down! - I'll take the skinny one!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.06,1:16:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真起来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game faces!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.06,1:16:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还在等什么？上啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what are you waiting for? Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.13,1:16:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我一招！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.22,1:16:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心！- 四处都是龙啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - The dragons are everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.43,1:17:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来啦！- 他们来啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Incoming! - Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.19,1:17:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方有攻击！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.66,1:17:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.20,1:17:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.14,1:17:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意！- 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heads up! - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.94,1:17:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.01,1:17:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.07,1:17:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 无牙仔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Toothless!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.17,1:17:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他还在乎你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still think he cares about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.64,1:17:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我们看看他到底会选谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just see who he follows.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.59,1:18:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 发生了这一切我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, bud, for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.78,1:18:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们去把她找回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's go get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.62,1:18:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,二当家冲锋陷阵！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number two coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.16,1:18:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,意不意外！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.73,1:18:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.19,1:18:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.56,1:18:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好！- 又放出一只！还有四只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right! - One more free! Four to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.40,1:18:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to keep up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.44,1:18:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会护着你的 哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your backs. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.28,1:18:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错嘛 我们简直像一个团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's almost like we're a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.25,1:19:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然让一只龙宝宝上战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a baby to a battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.28,1:19:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你 我绝对不会这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah-ah-ah. I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.23,1:19:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我好喜欢那条龙啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I love that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.70,1:19:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊！快回来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.81,1:19:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么晚才出场 真是抱歉啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry we're late for the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.81,1:19:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来得正是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.35,1:19:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了 它来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.36,1:19:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能把他从她背上轰下去 而又不伤害她呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna get him off her back without hurting her?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.10,1:19:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我的毛发瑟瑟发抖吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear the facial hair!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.35,1:20:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真是想念战场 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I have missed this. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.88,1:20:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. See that there?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.48,1:20:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw. Cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.52,1:20:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个坏兆头 你被诅咒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bad omen. You're cursed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.46,1:20:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 上啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.23,1:20:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good on you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.50,1:20:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在觉得你也没那么坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you're not so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.49,1:20:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃船！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.84,1:21:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.81,1:21:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们碰上麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we've got problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.46,1:21:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下他 小嗝嗝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him down, Hiccup!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.74,1:21:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得尽快想到一个更好的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a better plan, and quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.88,1:21:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, what are, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.32,1:21:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.46,1:22:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where has he gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.35,1:22:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让我们俩同归于尽的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill both of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.85,1:22:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为一条龙而战？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting over a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.32,1:22:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.79,1:22:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.53,1:22:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.60,1:23:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.61,1:23:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.01,1:23:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd come around.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.05,1:24:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 早上好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Good morning, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.05,1:24:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.65,1:24:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是能给我们惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you're full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.86,1:24:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.04,1:24:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃雷可能是有过人的体魄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Eret may be blessed with brawn,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.64,1:24:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别告诉别人 你的谋略胜于他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, just between us, you have the brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.54,1:24:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.61,1:25:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 老兄 时候到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, bud. It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.15,1:25:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来 我都在为自己追寻的世界而战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so busy fighting for a world that I wanted,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.02,1:25:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,却从没想过你到底需要什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think about what you needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.16,1:25:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照顾我们够久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've looked after us for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.76,1:25:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候为你自己着想了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to look after yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.58,1:25:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 风里飞 我的好姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Stormfly, my good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.92,1:25:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 格拉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.18,1:25:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.19,1:25:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你陪我已经这么久了 丑大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, you big ugly beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.49,1:25:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.50,1:26:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 云中跃 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Cloudjumper. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.85,1:26:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.85,1:26:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带向隐秘之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead them to the Hidden World.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.95,1:26:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里你们会很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.15,1:26:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你和我在一起时安全得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safer than you could ever be with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.82,1:26:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.83,1:26:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我希望你能得到自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you to be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.20,1:26:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的世界还不值得你停留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our world doesn't deserve you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.90,1:26:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就目前而言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.58,1:26:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 无牙仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.08,1:26:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.00,1:29:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们祝福酋长和酋长夫人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the chief and chieftess!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.30,1:29:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们幸福！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good on you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.21,1:29:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 把头埋在我浓密的胡子上哭泣吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, cry into my full, thick beard.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.68,1:29:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.94,1:29:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.18,1:29:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 算你赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you win.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.35,1:29:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢多愁善感的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like sensitive guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.85,1:29:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为这一天永远不会到来呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it would never happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.69,1:29:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有生之年 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.45,1:30:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我还是个小孩的时候 我身边有很多龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were dragons when I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.09,1:30:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当中有美丽威严 在天空中飞的龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, there were great, grim sky dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.43,1:30:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,像可怕的巨鸟一样 栖息在悬崖顶部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that nested on the clifftops like gigantic, scary birds.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.86,1:30:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有小小的 棕色的 在地上跑的龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little, brown, scuttling dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.33,1:30:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们成群结队 消灭地上的老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that hunted down the mice and rats in well-organized packs.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.94,1:30:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有大得惊人的海龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preposterously huge sea dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.37,1:30:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有蓝鲸的20倍大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that were 20 times as big as the big blue whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.35,1:30:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说他们潜回海中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say they crawled back into the sea,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.85,1:30:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有留下骨头 毒牙 让人寻不到他们存在的痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving not a bone nor a fang for men to remember them by.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.45,1:30:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人说 他们不过就是一些民间故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others say they were nothing but folktales to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.16,1:30:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受这种说法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.92,1:31:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.82,1:31:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.80,1:31:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.07,1:31:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄 我也很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I am glad to see you, too, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.04,1:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会吃掉你们爸爸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna eat your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.48,1:31:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的尾巴怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the tail holding up?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.32,1:31:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能需要加点油 调整一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably could use some oil and a little fine-tuning.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.15,1:31:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 没事的 他们是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's okay. They're friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.29,1:32:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啦行啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.53,1:32:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.93,1:32:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.56,1:32:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.50,1:32:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会伤害你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.93,1:32:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的手伸出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your hands out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.60,1:32:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.14,1:32:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.44,1:32:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他靠近你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him come to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.36,1:33:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,传闻说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend says that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.37,1:33:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当大地震动 或者岩浆从地表漫出的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the ground quakes or lava spews from the earth,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.14,1:33:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是龙为了让我们知道他们的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the dragons, letting us know they're still here,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.24,1:33:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着我们可以和他们和平共处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for us to figure out how to get along.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.68,1:33:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 世间众人都认为就算龙真实存在过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the world believes the dragons are gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.69,1:33:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也已经消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they ever existed at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.39,1:33:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们维京人知道事实不是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we Berkians, we know otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.40,1:33:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会一直守候这个秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll guard this secret until the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.56,1:33:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到龙可以和平归来的那一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when dragons can return in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.08,1:34:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我和你 我们经历了一切 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You and I, we've been through it all ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.28,1:34:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 现在是时候说再见了吗？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Is it time to say good-bye? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.32,1:34:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 擦干你的眼泪 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dry your eye ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.12,1:34:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们在彼此身旁 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We have been together ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.43,1:34:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 已经这么久了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So long ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.10,1:34:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 现在是时候放手了吗？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Is it time to let go? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.27,1:34:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们天各一方 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Apart we grow ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.53,1:34:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 很快我们就会知道 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Soon we will know ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.04,1:34:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是我继续生活下去的理由 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You are the reason to go on living ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.08,1:34:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我会不断尝试新事物 一切全靠我自己 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I need to try things and be on my own ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.12,1:34:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们会是永远的朋友 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll always be friends ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.46,1:34:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们会保持一定距离 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll keep our distance ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.32,1:34:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但即使天各一方 我们的心永远都在一起 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll be together from afar forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.56,1:34:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你听 你听 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Listen, listen ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.30,1:34:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 用心听… ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Within, ooh-ooh… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.14,1:35:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们走过世界每个角落 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We have been, we've been everywhere ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.08,1:35:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾至星空又复返 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To the stars and back again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.15,1:35:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是的 我的朋友 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yes, my friend ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.08,1:35:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们见识过大千世界 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We have seen, we've seen everything ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.72,1:35:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可我还能再见到你吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But will I ever see you again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.16,1:35:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的老朋友？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My old friend? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.36,1:35:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一直到最后我们都是朋友… ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Friends till the end… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.13,1:35:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You are the reason ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.50,1:35:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续生活下去的理由 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To go on living ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.34,1:35:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我会不断尝试新事物 一切全靠我自己 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I need to try things and be on my own ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.71,1:35:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们会是永远的朋友 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll always be friends ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.25,1:35:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们会保持一定距离 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll keep our distance ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.18,1:35:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但即使天各一方 我们的心永远都在一起 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll be together from afar forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.39,1:35:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你听 你听 用心听 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Listen, listen, within ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.41,1:36:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你和我 我们要说再见了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You and I, we say our good-byes ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.71,1:36:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 什么时候才能再见到你呢？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When will I see you again? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.85,1:36:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你和我 我们要说再见了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You and I, we say our good-byes ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.52,1:36:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 什么时候才能再见到你呢？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When will I see you again? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.13,1:36:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你和我 我们要说再见了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You and I, we say our good-byes ∮
